  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mbolo - Driving women&#xbf;s economic activities in 11 rural communities in The Gambia to green economy through the lens of gender equality (2020-2022)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the Action contributes to building green economy in The Gambia. It seeks to provide diverse opportunities for economic development and poverty alleviation without liquidating or eroding the communitys natural assets by empowering rural young women through access to renewable energy solutions titled Reinvigorated the local women economy of 11 rural communities (West Coast Region, North Bank and CRR South and North) in The Gambia by accessing solar energy&apos;&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
